<div class="product-right-content">
	
	<!--page content start-->
	<div class="product-info active">
		<h2>Poly Max™ Polyester Acoustic Wall &amp; Ceiling Panels</h2>
<p>High-Performance Acoustics with Modern Design &amp; Material Integrity<br />
Poly Max™ acoustic panels provide an elegant and sustainable solution for controlling echo and reverberation across a wide range of interior environments. Engineered for both performance and aesthetics, these panels are ideal for wall and ceiling applications in commercial, educational, residential, and aquatic spaces.</p>
<p></br></p>
<p><strong>Sustainable Materials for Demanding Environments</strong></p>
<p>Manufactured from 100% polyester fiber—a blend of 60% post-consumer recycled PET and 40% virgin PET—Poly Max panels are:</p>
<ul>
<li>Non-toxic, non-allergenic, and formaldehyde-free</li>
<li>Resistant to mold, mildew, and fungi</li>
<li>Certified for low VOC emissions (CDPH V1.2 compliant)</li>
<li>Contributing toward LEED v4.1 EQ Credit: Low-Emitting Materials</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The core PET composition offers significant advantages over traditional acoustic materials:</p>
<ul>
<li>Hydrophobic and non-hygroscopic, ensuring an extremely low moisture absorption rate</li>
<li>Maintains dimensional stability in high-humidity environments (e.g., natatoriums)</li>
<li>Will not swell, sag, or degrade under prolonged moisture exposure</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Proven Durability in Aquatic and Humid Environments</strong></p>
<p>Poly Max is specifically suited for high-humidity, chemically exposed environments like indoor pools and aquatic centers:</p>
<ul>
<li>Microbial Resistance: PET is a non-organic, moisture-repellent substrate that resists mold and mildew growth. Verified through ASTM C1338 fungal resistance testing, Poly Max achieved the highest possible rating—zero fungal growth.</li>
<li>Chemical Resistance: PET is chemically stable and highly resistant to airborne chloramines and cleaning agents. Unlike metal or organic-based products, it will not corrode, oxidize, or break down, ensuring long-term performance and <strong>visual appeal</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<p></br></p>
<p><strong>Design Versatility</strong></p>
<p>Poly Max panels balance affordability and architectural appeal with customization options that support diverse design intents:</p>
<ul>
<li>Available in a wide range of colors, plus custom-printed graphics or photo-quality imagery</li>
<li>Tackable surface ideal for workspaces and classrooms</li>
<li>Engravable for added visual texture, branding, or artwork integration</li>
</ul>
 

				<p class="pi-btn"><a href="#">See less</a></p>
		
	</div>
	<!--page content end-->

